sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GMUI as ContentManagerUI
  participant API as CompendiumRouter
  participant APP as CompendiumApplicationService
  participant LIFE as ContentLifecycleApplicationService
  participant LRES as LinkedEntryResolutionService
  participant DEF as DefinitionRepository
  participant REV as CatalogRevisionRepository
  participant IDX as SearchIndexRepository
  participant EVT as ContentEventsMapper
  participant SHEET as CharacterSheetStore
  participant WS as ContentStream

  Note over GMUI,WS: Precondition: spell.fire_shield_v1 published, catalog_revision=410

  GMUI->>API: POST /api/spells req-5101 (spell.fire_shield_v2 draft)
  API->>APP: create_definition(req-5101)
  APP->>DEF: create(spell.fire_shield_v2@v1 draft)
  DEF-->>APP: persisted
  APP->>REV: create_revision(reason=mutation, req-5101)
  REV-->>APP: catalog_revision=411
  APP->>IDX: upsert_document(v2 draft hidden from player scope)
  IDX-->>APP: indexed
  APP-->>API: resolved rev411
  API-->>GMUI: 201 Created

  GMUI->>API: POST /api/spells/spell.fire_shield_v2/supersede req-5102 payload(replaces=spell.fire_shield_v1)
  API->>LIFE: supersede_definition(req-5102)
  LIFE->>LRES: validate_replacement_chain(v1 -> v2)
  LRES-->>LIFE: ok (acyclic)
  LIFE->>DEF: set replaced_by_ref on v1 and replacement_of_ref on v2
  DEF-->>LIFE: replacement links persisted
  LIFE->>REV: create_revision(reason=supersede, req-5102)
  REV-->>LIFE: catalog_revision=412
  LIFE->>IDX: upsert_documents(v1,v2 with replacement metadata)
  IDX-->>LIFE: index updated
  LIFE->>EVT: to_linked_entries_updated_event(req-5102, rev412)
  EVT-->>WS: linked_entries_updated(event)
  LIFE-->>API: resolved rev412
  API-->>GMUI: 200 OK

  GMUI->>API: POST /api/spells/spell.fire_shield_v2/publish req-5103
  API->>LIFE: publish_definition(req-5103)
  LIFE->>DEF: set v2 published
  DEF-->>LIFE: persisted
  LIFE->>REV: create_revision(reason=publish, req-5103)
  REV-->>LIFE: catalog_revision=413
  LIFE->>IDX: set v2 visible in published scope
  IDX-->>LIFE: index updated
  LIFE->>EVT: to_definition_published_event(req-5103, rev413)
  EVT-->>WS: definition_published(event)
  LIFE-->>API: resolved rev413
  API-->>GMUI: 200 OK

  GMUI->>API: POST /api/spells/spell.fire_shield_v1/archive req-5104
  API->>LIFE: archive_definition(req-5104)
  LIFE->>DEF: set v1 archived
  DEF-->>LIFE: persisted
  LIFE->>REV: create_revision(reason=archive, req-5104)
  REV-->>LIFE: catalog_revision=414
  LIFE->>IDX: mark v1 archived and replacement target=v2
  IDX-->>LIFE: index updated
  LIFE->>EVT: to_definition_archived_event(req-5104, rev414)
  EVT-->>WS: definition_archived(event)
  LIFE-->>API: resolved rev414
  API-->>GMUI: 200 OK

  WS-->>SHEET: definition_archived(v1,replacement=v2,rev414)
  SHEET->>SHEET: follow_replacement_chain(v1->v2)
  SHEET->>SHEET: refresh cached reference for active actor

  Note over GMUI,SHEET: Postcondition: viewer resolves fire_shield to v2 under revision 414